sequenceDiagram
    participant SRE as SRE / Support Engineer
    participant OC as oc adm must-gather<br/>Framework
    participant Pod as must-gather Pod<br/>/usr/bin/gather
    participant Detect as Distribution Detection<br/>xks_util.sh
    participant Collectors as Parallel Collectors<br/>(14+ scripts)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant FS as /must-gather/<br/>Local Filesystem

    SRE->>OC: oc adm must-gather --image=<must-gather-image>
    OC->>Pod: Launch pod with caller's kubeconfig<br/>Inject credentials
    activate Pod

    Pod->>Detect: Detect Kubernetes distribution
    activate Detect
    Detect->>K8sAPI: Check infrastructure CRDs<br/>Node metadata, kernel, provider IDs
    K8sAPI-->>Detect: Cluster metadata
    Detect-->>Pod: Distribution type<br/>(OpenShift / AKS / EKS / CoreWeave)
    deactivate Detect

    Pod->>Pod: Collect cluster-scoped resources<br/>(DSCi, DSC, CRDs, webhooks, VAPs)

    Pod->>K8sAPI: oc adm inspect / kubectl get<br/>Cluster-scoped platform CRDs
    K8sAPI-->>Pod: DSCInitialization, DataScienceCluster,<br/>Component CRs, webhook configs

    Pod->>Collectors: Dispatch parallel collection jobs
    activate Collectors

    par Data Science Pipelines
        Collectors->>K8sAPI: oc adm inspect DSP namespaces<br/>CRDs, pod logs, events
        K8sAPI-->>Collectors: DSP resources & logs
    and KServe / Model Serving
        Collectors->>K8sAPI: oc adm inspect KServe resources<br/>InferenceService, ServingRuntime
        K8sAPI-->>Collectors: KServe resources & logs
    and Model Registry
        Collectors->>K8sAPI: kubectl get from rhoai-model-registries<br/>Model Registry CRDs
        K8sAPI-->>Collectors: Model Registry resources
    and llm-d
        Collectors->>K8sAPI: kubectl get LLMInferenceService,<br/>InferencePool, Gateway API resources
        K8sAPI-->>Collectors: llm-d resources & logs
    and Other Components
        Collectors->>K8sAPI: Collect KubeRay, Kueue, Training,<br/>TrustyAI, Feast, MLflow, Spark,<br/>AI Gateway, MCP, OGX
        K8sAPI-->>Collectors: Component resources & logs
    end

    Collectors->>FS: Write collected data<br/>(YAML, logs, events)
    deactivate Collectors

    Note over Collectors,FS: OpenShift: oc adm inspect<br/>xKS: kubectl_inspect (custom function)

    Pod->>FS: Finalize collection directory
    deactivate Pod

    OC->>FS: Copy /must-gather/ from pod
    FS-->>OC: Collected artifacts tarball
    OC-->>SRE: must-gather archive<br/>(tar.gz on workstation)
